WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.051 --> 00:00:03.818
WE'LL TRY AGAIN ANYWAY TO HAVE

00:00:03.819 --> 00:00:04.218
IT.

00:00:04.219 --> 00:00:05.553
LOUIS MIRANDA THE FORMER

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:06.654
D.N.C. COMMUNICATIONS DIRECTOR

00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:07.555
AND JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:07.556 --> 00:00:08.589
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.657
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, TUCKER.

00:00:09.658 --> 00:00:10.558
I APPRECIATE THE OPPORTUNITY

00:00:10.559 --> 00:00:12.293
TO HAVE AN HONEST CONVERSATION

00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:14.329
ON THIS.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.165
PARTICULAR PARTICULARLY, AS WE

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:19.233
ARE -- PARTICULARLY, AS WE ARE

00:00:19.234 --> 00:00:20.168
REMEMBERING GEORGE H.W. BUSH

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:22.770
WHO TAUGHT US WE CAN DISAGREE

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:25.239
ON SOME OF THESE ISSUES.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.141
I WENT TO THE CAPITOL AFTER

00:00:27.142 --> 00:00:28.543
LEAVING THE STUDIO TO SEE HIM.

00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:29.344
I TOOK THE KIDS.

00:00:29.345 --> 00:00:30.211
THAT IS SOMETHING WE TALK

00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:30.545
ABOUT.

00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:31.446
THERE ARE DIFFERENT

00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:32.747
PERSPECTIVES ON THE ISSUES BUT

00:00:32.748 --> 00:00:34.449
WE CAN TALK ABOUT THEM

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:34.882
RESPECTFULLY.

00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:36.584
WHAT YOU LAID OUT BRINGS UP

00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:37.318
LEGITNATE ISSUES.

00:00:37.319 --> 00:00:38.486
THE QUESTION IS --

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:39.320
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOLD ON.

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:41.022
THAT IS WHAT I LIKE ABOUT WHAT

00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:41.889
IS HAPPENING IN TIJUANA.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.858
I FEEL DEEPLY FOR THE PEOPLE

00:00:43.859 --> 00:00:44.258
OF TIJUANA.

00:00:44.259 --> 00:00:45.393
I THINK THEY ARE GOING THROUGH

00:00:45.394 --> 00:00:46.594
WHAT A LOT OF AMERICANS HAVE

00:00:46.595 --> 00:00:47.161
GONE THROUGH.

00:00:47.162 --> 00:00:48.763
BUT BECAUSE IT IS TIJUANA AND

00:00:48.764 --> 00:00:51.065
IT IS MEXICO WE CAN'T DISMISS

00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:52.300
THEM AS ANTI-HISPANIC.

00:00:52.301 --> 00:00:54.268
WE HAVE TO LOOK FOR CLEARLY AT

00:00:54.269 --> 00:00:55.336
WHAT THE CONCERNS ARE.

00:00:55.337 --> 00:00:57.105
SO MY QUESTION TO YOU IS

00:00:57.106 --> 00:00:57.739
SIMPLE ONE.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.007
LOOKING AT THE CONCERNS WE

00:00:59.008 --> 00:01:00.641
JUST PLAYED ON TAPE, THOSE ARE

00:01:00.642 --> 00:01:01.943
REAL, DOES IT MAKE YOU A

00:01:01.944 --> 00:01:04.112
LITTLE MORE EMPATHETIC TOWARD

00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:05.513
OUR FELLOW AMERICANS WHO HAVE

00:01:05.514 --> 00:01:06.647
SIMILAR FEELINGS?

00:01:06.648 --> 00:01:08.516
&gt;&gt; I THINK WE HAVE TO BE

00:01:08.517 --> 00:01:09.784
EMPATHETIC ALL AROUND HERE AND

00:01:09.785 --> 00:01:11.019
THAT INCLUDES PEOPLE WHO HAVE

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:11.886
LEGITIMATE CONCERNS.

00:01:11.887 --> 00:01:13.755
BUT A LOT OF THE CONCERNS ARE

00:01:13.756 --> 00:01:14.756
STOKED WITHOUT A BASIS OF

00:01:14.757 --> 00:01:15.089
REALITY.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.524
HERE IS THE PROBLEM THAT A LOT

00:01:16.525 --> 00:01:17.525
OF THE IMMIGRANTS THAT ARE

00:01:17.526 --> 00:01:20.628
PART OF THE CARAVAN ARE DECENT

00:01:20.629 --> 00:01:22.063
PEOPLE FLEEING VIOLENCE OR

00:01:22.064 --> 00:01:24.198
ECONOMIC SITUATIONS THAT ARE

00:01:24.199 --> 00:01:24.565
UNTENABLE.

00:01:24.566 --> 00:01:25.967
BUT THEY ARE VICTIMS ALL

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.235
AROUND BECAUSE THEY ARE BEING

00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:28.336
VICTIMIZED BY THE HUMAN

00:01:28.337 --> 00:01:30.338
TRAFFICKERS AND THE SMUGGLERS

00:01:30.339 --> 00:01:31.939
THAT WANT TO TAKE ADVANTAGE OF

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:32.306
THEM.

00:01:32.307 --> 00:01:33.107
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I AGREE WITH

00:01:33.108 --> 00:01:33.508
THAT.

00:01:33.509 --> 00:01:34.742
&gt;&gt; THERE IS AN A.P. ANALYSIS

00:01:34.743 --> 00:01:36.377
THAT CAME OUT THAT 4,000 OF

00:01:36.378 --> 00:01:37.578
THE PEOPLE DISAPPEARED IN THE

00:01:37.579 --> 00:01:38.646
LAST FEW YEARS ON THE WAY.

00:01:38.647 --> 00:01:39.547
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YES.

00:01:39.548 --> 00:01:40.782
&gt;&gt; IN OTHER WORDS, THE FAMILY

00:01:40.783 --> 00:01:41.749
HAS NO IDEA WHAT HAPPENED TO

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.083
THEM.

00:01:42.084 --> 00:01:44.085
THEY EITHER GOT MURDERED OR --

00:01:44.086 --> 00:01:44.519
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.020
&gt;&gt; OR WORSE ALONG THE WAY.

00:01:46.021 --> 00:01:49.223
SO THERE IS A LEGITIMATE

00:01:49.224 --> 00:01:50.324
HUMANITARIAN CRISIS OF PEOPLE

00:01:50.325 --> 00:01:50.925
TAKEN ADVANTAGE OF.

00:01:50.926 --> 00:01:52.160
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I AGREE WITH

00:01:52.161 --> 00:01:52.493
THAT.

00:01:52.494 --> 00:01:53.461
I TOTALLY AGREE.

00:01:53.462 --> 00:01:54.662
BUT I WANT TO SHINE THE LIGHT

00:01:54.663 --> 00:01:56.731
ON THE VICTIMS WHO DON'T GET

00:01:56.732 --> 00:01:57.765
REPRESENTATION OF ANY KIND IN

00:01:57.766 --> 00:01:58.433
THE PRESS.

00:01:58.434 --> 00:01:59.934
THOSE ARE THE CITIZENS WHO ARE

00:01:59.935 --> 00:02:01.836
HAVING TO ABSORB LARGE

00:02:01.837 --> 00:02:03.337
POPULATIONS OF -- I AGREE WITH

00:02:03.338 --> 00:02:04.839
YOU, LARGELY DECENT PEOPLE.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.140
I THINK MOST MIGRANTS WANT

00:02:06.141 --> 00:02:06.707
WHAT I WANT.

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:07.942
A BETTER LIFE FOR THEIR

00:02:07.943 --> 00:02:08.276
FAMILY.

00:02:08.277 --> 00:02:09.043
I GET IT.

00:02:09.044 --> 00:02:12.180
&gt;&gt; THAT IS RIGHT.

00:02:12.181 --> 00:02:13.214
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I HAVE ALWAYS

00:02:13.215 --> 00:02:13.648
THOUGHT THAT.

00:02:13.649 --> 00:02:14.549
BUT HOLD ON.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.950
IT'S IMPORTANT TO EMPHASIZE AS

00:02:15.951 --> 00:02:17.318
DEEPLY WITH THE CITIZENS WHO

00:02:17.319 --> 00:02:18.986
LIVES ARE BEING UP-ENDED BY

00:02:18.987 --> 00:02:20.254
THE ARRIVAL OF THE IMMIGRANTS

00:02:20.255 --> 00:02:22.790
AS THE UP GRANTS THEMSELVES --

00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:24.158
AS THE IMMIGRANTS THEMSELVES.

00:02:24.159 --> 00:02:25.960
IF YOU SEE THIS, CAN YOU SAY

00:02:25.961 --> 00:02:27.061
THE AMERICAN CITIZENS SAY I

00:02:27.062 --> 00:02:27.862
DON'T WANT IMMIGRATION.

00:02:27.863 --> 00:02:29.297
WE HAVE HAD MORE THAN WE CAN

00:02:29.298 --> 00:02:30.731
HANDLE.

00:02:30.732 --> 00:02:32.733
THEY ARE NOT JUST RACISTS.

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.001
THEY HAVE A POINT.

00:02:34.002 --> 00:02:36.237
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE NOT RACISTS BUT

00:02:36.238 --> 00:02:37.171
IT'S IMPORTANT TO UNDERSTAND

00:02:37.172 --> 00:02:39.140
THE OTHER SIDE THAT IMMIGRANTS

00:02:39.141 --> 00:02:40.341
MADE OUR ECONOMY STRONGER OVER

00:02:40.342 --> 00:02:41.442
THE YEARS.

00:02:41.443 --> 00:02:43.478
LET ME ADD COLOR TO WHAT YOU

00:02:43.479 --> 00:02:44.579
SAID IN THE BEGINNING.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.514
THE POPULATION IS AGING.

00:02:46.515 --> 00:02:48.382
WE HAVE BABY BOOMERS RETIRING.

00:02:48.383 --> 00:02:50.485
A LOT OF THE PEOPLE WE ARE

00:02:50.486 --> 00:02:51.986
ABLE TO REPLACE IN THE ECONOMY

00:02:51.987 --> 00:02:52.987
ARE BECAUSE OF IMMIGRATION.

00:02:52.988 --> 00:02:55.089
WE WANT TO DO THAT IDEALLY IN

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.324
A LEGAL AND AN ORDERLY

00:02:56.325 --> 00:02:56.757
FASHION.

00:02:56.758 --> 00:02:57.692
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CAN I STOP YOU

00:02:57.693 --> 00:02:59.260
THERE AND ASK A QUESTION.

00:02:59.261 --> 00:02:59.894
&gt;&gt; NO, NO.

00:02:59.895 --> 00:03:00.328
HOLD ON.

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.195
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I NEED TO ASK

00:03:01.196 --> 00:03:01.696
THIS QUESTION.

00:03:01.697 --> 00:03:03.531
YOU SAY OUR POPULATION IS

00:03:03.532 --> 00:03:03.831
AGING.

00:03:03.832 --> 00:03:05.633
WE ARE NOT REPRODUCING

00:03:05.634 --> 00:03:06.000
OURSELVES.

00:03:06.001 --> 00:03:07.335
WHY DO YOU THINK THAT IS?

00:03:07.336 --> 00:03:10.071
NOBODY SEEMS TO PAUSE AND ASK

00:03:10.072 --> 00:03:10.938
WHY CAN'T YOUNG AMERICANS

00:03:10.939 --> 00:03:12.440
AFFORD TO GET MARRIED AND HAVE

00:03:12.441 --> 00:03:13.975
CHILDREN, AFFORD TO BUY HOMES

00:03:13.976 --> 00:03:16.644
AND CARS AND THE SOLUTION IS

00:03:16.645 --> 00:03:17.778
WE'LL BRING IN NEW PEOPLE.

00:03:17.779 --> 00:03:18.980
WHAT ABOUT THE AMERICANS, THE

00:03:18.981 --> 00:03:20.381
YOUNG PEOPLE, THE 30-YEAR-OLD

00:03:20.382 --> 00:03:22.049
AMERICAN WHO CAN'T AFFORD TO

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:22.850
HAVE KIDS?

00:03:22.851 --> 00:03:24.018
DOES ANYBODY CARE ABOUT THAT

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:24.385
PERSON?

00:03:24.386 --> 00:03:26.354
MAYBE THERE IS A REAL

00:03:26.355 --> 00:03:27.688
PROBLEM -- I NEVER HEAR THAT

00:03:27.689 --> 00:03:30.191
PERSON ADDRESSED EVER.

00:03:30.192 --> 00:03:31.425
&gt;&gt; IT'S AN INDUSTRIALIZED

00:03:31.426 --> 00:03:31.826
COUNTRY.

00:03:31.827 --> 00:03:32.960
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M AN AMERICAN.

00:03:32.961 --> 00:03:33.628
HOLD ON.

00:03:33.629 --> 00:03:34.362
I'M AN AMERICAN.

00:03:34.363 --> 00:03:36.430
SO MY CONCERN IS FOR MY FELLOW

00:03:36.431 --> 00:03:36.797
AMERICANS.

00:03:36.798 --> 00:03:38.933
AND THEY CAN'T AFFORD TO HAVE

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:39.300
CHILDREN.

00:03:39.301 --> 00:03:40.935
BUT RATHER THAN FIX THEIR

00:03:40.936 --> 00:03:42.103
PROBLEMS OR EVEN THINK ABOUT

00:03:42.104 --> 00:03:44.138
THEM WE ARE LIKE WE'LL JUST

00:03:44.139 --> 00:03:46.641
IMPORT NEW CHILDREN.

00:03:46.642 --> 00:03:48.476
ISN'T THAT A BACKWARD WAY

00:03:48.477 --> 00:03:49.310
APPROACH IT?

00:03:49.311 --> 00:03:50.278
&gt;&gt; WE SHOULD DO BOTH.

00:03:50.279 --> 00:03:52.346
IN THE LAST TEN YEARS AMERICAN

00:03:52.347 --> 00:03:53.447
COMPANIES AND STOCKS

00:03:53.448 --> 00:03:54.482
OUTPERFORMED THE REST OF THE

00:03:54.483 --> 00:03:55.383
WORLD BY A LOT.

00:03:55.384 --> 00:03:56.684
THE AMERICAN ECONOMY HAS BEEN

00:03:56.685 --> 00:03:57.685
SO STRONG IN THE LAST TEN

00:03:57.686 --> 00:03:58.519
YEARS COMPARED TO ANYTHING

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.287
ELSE IN THE WORLD.

00:03:59.288 --> 00:04:00.488
PART OF THE REASON FOR THAT IS

00:04:00.489 --> 00:04:01.956
WE HAVE AN ECONOMY THAT IS

00:04:01.957 --> 00:04:03.524
CONSTANTLY RENEWING ITSELF.

00:04:03.525 --> 00:04:04.692
SO WE ABSOLUTELY SHOULD BE

00:04:04.693 --> 00:04:05.893
ABLE TO HAVE AN ECONOMY WHERE

00:04:05.894 --> 00:04:06.894
PEOPLE WHO WANT TO HAVE

00:04:06.895 --> 00:04:07.962
CHILDREN CAN DO SO.

00:04:07.963 --> 00:04:10.131
BUT IT DOESN'T MEAN WE

00:04:10.132 --> 00:04:10.798
DON'T --

00:04:10.799 --> 00:04:11.832
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT HOLD ON.

00:04:11.833 --> 00:04:13.134
NO, NO.

00:04:13.135 --> 00:04:15.836
YOU JUST SAID WE NEED TO BRING

00:04:15.837 --> 00:04:17.638
IN PEOPLE BECAUSE AMERICANS

00:04:17.639 --> 00:04:19.840
AREN'T REPRODUCING IN

00:04:19.841 --> 00:04:20.374
SUFFICIENT NUMBERS.

00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:21.642
MY QUESTION IS WHY AREN'T THE

00:04:21.643 --> 00:04:23.277
LEADERS THINKING ABOUT HOW OUR

00:04:23.278 --> 00:04:24.712
PEOPLE CAN AFFORD TO HAVE

00:04:24.713 --> 00:04:25.079
CHILDREN?

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.480
THEY DON'T EVEN CONSIDER THAT

00:04:26.481 --> 00:04:28.282
A SUBJECT WORTH STUDYING.

00:04:28.283 --> 00:04:29.650
MUCH LESS TRYING TO FIX.

00:04:29.651 --> 00:04:32.086
IT'S LIKE OH, WELL, THEY ARE

00:04:32.087 --> 00:04:33.254
NOT HAVING ENOUGH KIDS.

00:04:33.255 --> 00:04:35.189
WHY DON'T WE CARE ENOUGH?

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.624
&gt;&gt; THOSE ARE NOT MUTUALLY

00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:37.358
EXCLUSIVE THINGS.

00:04:37.359 --> 00:04:38.793
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU ARE SAYING

00:04:38.794 --> 00:04:40.027
THE LOW BIRTHRATE IS

00:04:40.028 --> 00:04:41.028
JUSTIFICATION FOR IMMIGRATION.

00:04:41.029 --> 00:04:45.366
I'M SAYING IT'S A TRAGEDY THAT

00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:46.834
SAYS SOMETHING ABOUT THE

00:04:46.835 --> 00:04:48.002
ECONOMY AND SELFISH STUPIDITY

00:04:48.003 --> 00:04:49.003
OF THE LEADERS.

00:04:49.004 --> 00:04:50.238
&gt;&gt; THE GROWTH AND THE

00:04:50.239 --> 00:04:51.138
PROSPERITY ENABLED US TO HAVE

00:04:51.139 --> 00:04:52.073
A STRONGER ECONOMY.

00:04:52.074 --> 00:04:54.442
THERE IS DEFINITELY BOTH SIDES

00:04:54.443 --> 00:04:56.377
TO THIS WHERE YOU CAN LOOK AT

00:04:56.378 --> 00:04:58.179
WELL WORK WILL BE HURT?

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.614
IF YOU LOOK AT STATES LIKE

00:04:59.615 --> 00:05:01.449
GEORGIA AND THE OTHERS

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.283
IMPLEMENTED ANTI-IMMIGRANT

00:05:02.284 --> 00:05:03.251
MEASURES THAT FORCE A LOT OF

00:05:03.252 --> 00:05:06.287
THE IMMIGRANTS OUT, WHAT YOU

00:05:06.288 --> 00:05:07.922
SAW WAS FOOD ROTTING ON THE

00:05:07.923 --> 00:05:08.222
VINES.

00:05:08.223 --> 00:05:10.091
A LOT OF LOST CROPS BECAUSE

00:05:10.092 --> 00:05:10.891
THERE WEREN'T ENOUGH PEOPLE

00:05:10.892 --> 00:05:12.059
THERE TO WORK THEM.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.995
SO THE REALITY IS THAT WE CAN

00:05:13.996 --> 00:05:15.696
BOTH DO SOMETHING ABOUT THIS

00:05:15.697 --> 00:05:17.064
FOR PEOPLE WHO ARE SUFFERING.

00:05:17.065 --> 00:05:19.400
AND WHO ARE AMERICAN AND WHO

00:05:19.401 --> 00:05:22.036
HAVE LIVED THERE THEIR WHOLE

00:05:22.037 --> 00:05:23.204
LIVES AND WANT TO HAVE

00:05:23.205 --> 00:05:24.171
CHILDREN AND DO BETTER THAN

00:05:24.172 --> 00:05:25.306
THEIR PARENTS.

00:05:25.307 --> 00:05:26.040
&gt;&gt; Tucker: MAYBE SOMEONE

00:05:26.041 --> 00:05:27.141
SHOULD CARE ABOUT THEM A

00:05:27.142 --> 00:05:27.808
LITTLE BIT.

00:05:27.809 --> 00:05:28.309
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:28.843
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE MOST

00:05:28.844 --> 00:05:29.710
IMPORTANT THING.

00:05:29.711 --> 00:05:31.646
&gt;&gt; IT DOESN'T MEAN WE HAVE TO

00:05:31.647 --> 00:05:33.214
DEMONIZE IMMIGRANTS WHO ARE

00:05:33.215 --> 00:05:33.814
LEGITIMATE --

00:05:33.815 --> 00:05:35.049
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M NOT

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:35.850
DEMONIZING ANYBODY.

00:05:35.851 --> 00:05:36.851
I'M NOT AGAINST THE

00:05:36.852 --> 00:05:37.251
IMMIGRANTS.

00:05:37.252 --> 00:05:39.287
I'M FOR THE AMERICANS.

00:05:39.288 --> 00:05:42.557
NOBODY CARES ABOUT THEM.

